{"unit_id": "tag:0071:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们来阐明某些类型的结构所成的层（sheaves）的定义。\n首先，我们换一种方式表述层条件（sheaf condition）。具体地说，设<MATH_0001>是一个预层（presheaf），取值为集合（sets），定义在拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0002>上。\n层条件（sheaf condition）可重述如下。设<MATH_0003>是一个开覆盖（covering）。考虑如下图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n这里，左侧的映射（map）由规则<MATH_0005>定义。右侧的两个映射（maps）分别是映射（maps）<MATHSEG_0001>和<MATHSEG_0002>\n层条件（sheaf condition）恰好是说，左侧的箭头是右侧两个箭头的等化子（equalizer）。这一表述可直接推广到预层（presheaves）取值于某个范畴（category）的情形，只要该范畴（category）具有积（products）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图式"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "用于指某些类型的结构所成的层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "用于引出该条件的改述并表明它与图式中的等化子条件等价。"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于称呼拓扑空间上的集合值预层。"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "用于说明预层的取值是集合。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "用于指定预层所定义的空间。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "用于开覆盖，其中「开」对应原文的 open。"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图式", "context": "用于指示以若干映射构成的范畴论图式。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于称呼由给定规则定义的左侧映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "用于称呼右侧的两个映射及对这两个映射的列举。"}, {"source_term": "equalizer", "target_term": "等化子", "context": "用于描述左侧箭头与右侧一对箭头的范畴论关系。"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "用于将所述表述推广到范畴值预层。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "用于指定预层的取值范畴，并对该范畴提出条件。"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积", "context": "用于给出取值范畴须具备的范畴论构造。"}], "notes": []}
